# Canonical production URL for metadata. Optional; Vercel URLs are used when absent.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com

# Local live Phantom demo. Production default: unset (off).
#
# Set to exactly "true" AND serve the site from loopback to make /demo offer
# the live Phantom proof mode. Both are required: a deployed build carrying
# this flag still refuses, because the page is not on loopback.
#
# It also needs the local proof environment running on http://127.0.0.1:4175
# and the adapter bundle built by `npm run live-demo:build` from the
# repository root. See docs/live-phantom-demo.md.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_EQUITYGUARD_LIVE_DEMO=true
